From 3a11e13be73cf064e92216327e5dd224cf8f73bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Travis Gilbert <1travisgilbert@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:31:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(a11y): publish a disabled Button as disabled on the
 Theorem Zed fork

Move the Zed pin to 45cde9a, which adds aria_disabled, and have Button
set it from the same flag that blocks its pointer input.
